OL,3,GNEWSAMan hit by bus missed
OL,4,Agranddaughter's birth by a day
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe family of a man who died after
OL,7,Fbeing hit by a bus in Greater
OL,8,FManchester said they were heartbroken
OL,9,Fhe missed the birth of his
OL,10,Fgranddaughter by just one day.
OL,12,FRoss Grealey died after he was struck
OL,13,Fnear Winifred Road in Stockport on 30
OL,14,FOctober, Greater Manchester Police
OL,15,Fsaid.
OL,17,FHis son, who is also called Ross, said
OL,18,Fa baby girl was born the following day
OL,19,Fand wished his father had been able to
OL,20,Fmeet her.
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
